{
  "video_id": "mjyx7S502Kg",
  "title": "⚡ Why this text message caused a panic! 😱 #Shorts",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-21 22:32:05",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.26,
      "end": 1.31,
      "en": "Alex,",
      "zh": "Alex，"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 1.31,
      "end": 10.82,
      "en": "¿sabes que un mensaje de texto muy normal en\nMéxico asustó muchísimo a una chica en\nEspaña?",
      "zh": "Alex，\n你知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 11.859,
      "end": 13.3,
      "en": "¿En serio,",
      "zh": "墨西哥一則很平常的簡訊，"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 13.3,
      "end": 14.0,
      "en": "Mia?",
      "zh": "墨西哥一則很平常的簡訊，\n嚇壞了西班牙的一個女生！"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.96,
      "end": 14.96,
      "en": "¿Qué decía el mensaje?",
      "zh": "真的嗎，"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 15.66,
      "end": 20.149,
      "en": "Un amigo mexicano tenía prisa y le escribió:",
      "zh": "真的嗎，\nMia？"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 20.149,
      "end": 23.46,
      "en": "\"Ahorita me lanzo en camión y te caigo en\nquince.",
      "zh": "真的嗎，\nMia？\n簡訊寫什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 23.951999999999998,
      "end": 24.693,
      "en": "¡Ja,",
      "zh": "一位墨西哥朋友趕時間，"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 24.693,
      "end": 24.94,
      "en": "ja!",
      "zh": "一位墨西哥朋友趕時間，\n就傳訊給她："
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 24.94,
      "end": 26.839,
      "en": "En México eso significa:",
      "zh": "「我現在搭卡車衝過去，"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 26.839,
      "end": 30.12,
      "en": "\"Voy en autobús y llego en quince minutos.",
      "zh": "「我現在搭卡車衝過去，\n十五分鐘後到。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 30.12,
      "end": 32.439,
      "en": "Pero en España,",
      "zh": "哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 32.439,
      "end": 35.84,
      "en": "\"camión\" es un vehículo gigante de carga,",
      "zh": "哈哈！\n在墨西哥，"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 35.84,
      "end": 37.82,
      "en": "no un autobús.",
      "zh": "這句話的意思是："
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 37.82,
      "end": 40.799,
      "en": "Y \"lanzarse\" suena a saltar.",
      "zh": "這句話的意思是：\n「我搭巴士，"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 41.5,
      "end": 42.28,
      "en": "¡Oh,",
      "zh": "十五分鐘後到。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 42.28,
      "end": 43.909,
      "en": "no!",
      "zh": "但在西班牙，"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 43.909,
      "end": 48.85,
      "en": "La chica española pensó que su amigo quería\nsaltar frente a un camión.",
      "zh": "但在西班牙，\n「camión」是指大型貨車，"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 50.24,
      "end": 51.2,
      "en": "Exacto,",
      "zh": "不是巴士。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 51.2,
      "end": 54.53,
      "en": "¡se llevó un susto terrible!",
      "zh": "不是巴士。\n而且「lanzarse」聽起來像跳躍。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 54.53,
      "end": 57.289,
      "en": "Para evitar este problema entre países,",
      "zh": "噢，天啊！"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 57.289,
      "end": 59.27,
      "en": "usa frases universales.",
      "zh": "噢，天啊！\n那個西班牙女生以為她朋友想跳到貨車前面自殺！"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 60.109,
      "end": 63.539,
      "en": "¿Cómo digo que voy en bus de forma segura?",
      "zh": "沒錯，"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 64.45,
      "end": 65.43,
      "en": "Di siempre:",
      "zh": "沒錯，\n她嚇壞了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 65.39,
      "end": 70.739,
      "en": "\"Voy a tomar el autobús\" o \"Voy en metro.\"",
      "zh": "為了避免這種跨國誤會，"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 70.739,
      "end": 73.56,
      "en": "Y en lugar de \"te caigo\",",
      "zh": "為了避免這種跨國誤會，\n要用比較通用的說法喔。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 73.56,
      "end": 74.459,
      "en": "di:",
      "zh": "那要怎麼安全地表達我要搭公車呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 74.459,
      "end": 75.7,
      "en": "\"Llego en quince minutos.",
      "zh": "就說："
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 76.79,
      "end": 79.7,
      "en": "¿Y si mi amigo pregunta \"¿Dónde estás ahora?\"",
      "zh": "就說：\n「我要搭巴士」或「我搭捷運」。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 79.7,
      "end": 81.4,
      "en": "o \"¿Ya vienes?",
      "zh": "另外，"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 82.489,
      "end": 84.349,
      "en": "Responde fácil:",
      "zh": "另外，\n別說「te caigo」，"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 84.349,
      "end": 87.39,
      "en": "\"Estoy en camino\" o \"Ya casi llego.",
      "zh": "要說："
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 87.959,
      "end": 90.329,
      "en": "Regla de oro:",
      "zh": "要說：\n「我十五分鐘後到」。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 90.329,
      "end": 93.25,
      "en": "en cualquier país usa \"tomar",
      "zh": "那如果朋友問我："
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 93.25,
      "end": 95.329,
      "en": "el autobús\",",
      "zh": "那如果朋友問我：\n「你現在在哪？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 95.329,
      "end": 97.359,
      "en": "\"estoy en camino\"",
      "zh": "那如果朋友問我：\n「你現在在哪？」\n或「你來了嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 97.359,
      "end": 99.409,
      "en": "y \"llego en quince minutos\".",
      "zh": "簡單回答："
    }
  ]
}